    "9": {
      "note": "_link preserves entry ID/kind, optional proof facet, invariant identity key, optional invariant revision/key and supplied range, and obtains families through _occurrences. With no listed family, _occurrences keeps the completeness-based state and supplies an own-side reason only for membership_unknown. Named occurrences preserve family identity/key/revision and the unchanged _membership state; _occurrence supplies an other-side reason only for membership_unknown. _membership_reason uses the reading's side name and detail, or its incomplete-family sentence, and passes the result through bounded_text. Other states receive reason=None.\n\nAnchor: inclusive source ranges",
